; Import definitions for the Vulkan loader (vulkan-1.dll, shipped with GPU drivers).
; Only the functions ggml-vulkan.cpp calls directly; everything else is resolved at
; runtime through vkGetInstanceProcAddr. If linking reports another undefined vk*
; symbol after a ggml bump, add it here.
LIBRARY vulkan-1.dll
EXPORTS
vkCmdCopyBuffer
vkGetInstanceProcAddr
vkGetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2